251
00:28:13,441 --> 00:28:15,360
gudang rumah kita kebanjiran.

252
00:28:16,236 --> 00:28:17,237
Ayo makan.

253
00:28:40,427 --> 00:28:44,389
Katanya, kau disidik polisi?
Jangan sebut kami meski kau dipenjara.

254
00:28:45,390 --> 00:28:48,518
Jangan bercanda. Aku sangat serius.

255
00:28:50,729 --> 00:28:52,397
Sudah baca yang kuberikan?

256
00:28:53,106 --> 00:28:54,691
Ini daftar uji klinis.

257
00:29:00,739 --> 00:29:03,116
Enam di antaranya yang melompat.

258
00:29:06,244 --> 00:29:08,496
Mundane Vanguard menguji orang biasa.

259
00:29:14,002 --> 00:29:15,128
BIASA

260
00:29:16,254 --> 00:29:19,007
Uji klinisnya
di kelab malam seluruh Gangnam.

261
00:29:20,258 --> 00:29:22,260
Diminati karena efek halusinasinya kuat.

262
00:29:30,977 --> 00:29:32,771
Pemasoknya bernama Hermes.

263
00:29:34,606 --> 00:29:36,149
Namanya Hermes?

264
00:29:38,109 --> 00:29:39,944
Tasnya selalu berbeda warna.

265
00:29:41,279 --> 00:29:44,365
Ada informasi,
Hermes akan ke Mecenat besok malam.

266
00:29:45,658 --> 00:29:48,286
Tangkap Hermes secepatnya
dan ambil obatnya.

267
00:29:49,204 --> 00:29:52,749
Seusai uji klinis,
kekuatan super akan diklonakan dan dijual.

268
00:29:54,292 --> 00:29:56,377
Sebelum ada lebih banyak korban…

269
00:29:59,047 --> 00:30:00,298
harus kita hentikan.

270
00:30:02,008 --> 00:30:04,260
SPEC-UP TERSEDIA LAGI, PEMASOK: MD HERMES

271
00:30:13,520 --> 00:30:15,063
Aku pulang.

272
00:30:15,563 --> 00:30:16,564
Sudah pulang?

273
00:30:18,775 --> 00:30:20,777
Ini apa? Kita pindah rumah?

274
00:30:23,321 --> 00:30:24,322
Cepat lepas baju.

275
00:30:24,405 --> 00:30:25,657
- Sekarang?
- Ya.

276
00:30:26,241 --> 00:30:27,450
Aku tak punya uang.

277
00:30:28,451 --> 00:30:30,161
- Tarik tunai?
- Apa maksudmu?

278
00:30:30,662 --> 00:30:32,038
Pilih baju untuk besok.

279
00:30:32,121 --> 00:30:34,666
Aku baru ingat. Pertemuan keluarga.

280
00:30:35,625 --> 00:30:38,044
Kenapa tak jawab telepon? Ada masalah?

281
00:30:39,504 --> 00:30:42,340
Tidak. Ponselku di tas. Maaf.

282
00:30:42,841 --> 00:30:44,217
Itu harus lancar.

283
00:30:45,051 --> 00:30:46,594
Urutan pernikahanku kacau.

284
00:30:47,095 --> 00:30:51,766
Registrasi pernikahan, undian rumah,
lamaran, lalu pertemuan keluarga.

285
00:30:52,392 --> 00:30:53,768
Jika besok kacau,

286
00:30:54,269 --> 00:30:56,104
usahaku dan Min-suk selama ini

287
00:30:56,604 --> 00:30:59,440
akan menjadi sia-sia.

288
00:31:02,819 --> 00:31:04,779
Ini paling bagus.

289
00:31:05,280 --> 00:31:06,447
- Cobalah.
- Ya.

290
00:31:08,032 --> 00:31:09,242
Ini bagus sekali.

291
00:31:11,369 --> 00:31:13,496
Kenapa kau beli semahal ini?

292
00:31:13,580 --> 00:31:16,040
Ini pertemuan keluarga. Jaga baik-baik.

293
00:31:20,044 --> 00:31:21,421
Harganya 1,29 juta won?

294
00:31:23,339 --> 00:31:25,383
Bajumu bahkan tak semahal ini.

295
00:31:28,303 --> 00:31:29,387
Kau aman, 'kan?

296
00:31:30,221 --> 00:31:31,806
Ya, aman. Tentu saja.

297
00:31:46,613 --> 00:31:48,865
Kau tampan. Di Jongno, pukul tujuh malam.

298
00:31:49,574 --> 00:31:50,408
Jangan telat.

299
00:31:51,284 --> 00:31:52,243
Oke.

300
00:31:58,541 --> 00:31:59,709
Ini.

301
00:32:01,836 --> 00:32:03,922
- Aku terbang jika macet.
- Apa?

302
00:32:04,005 --> 00:32:06,382
Itu untuk jaga-jaga. Jangan dihamburkan.

303
00:32:06,466 --> 00:32:07,425
Oke.

304
00:32:09,552 --> 00:32:10,720
Boleh tambah 50.000 won?

305
00:32:10,803 --> 00:32:12,597
- Tidak.
- Ya, oke.

306
00:32:13,431 --> 00:32:14,891
- Sampai nanti.
- Ya.

307
00:32:15,767 --> 00:32:16,601
Dah.

308
00:32:19,812 --> 00:32:20,855
Aku berangkat.

309
00:32:26,486 --> 00:32:28,237
Gangnam ke Jongno satu jam.

310
00:32:28,738 --> 00:32:30,448
Menangkap Hermes sampai pukul enam

311
00:32:30,531 --> 00:32:32,825
lalu pertemuan keluarga
pukul tujuh di Jongno.

312
00:32:33,326 --> 00:32:34,285
Aku pasti bisa.

313
00:32:39,248 --> 00:32:44,921
MECENAT

314
00:32:55,723 --> 00:32:56,724
Kau di mana?

315
00:33:14,575 --> 00:33:15,618
Kami sudah masuk.

316
00:33:18,997 --> 00:33:21,040
Wah, aku ke kelab di hari sakral.

317
00:33:21,916 --> 00:33:23,376
Situasi macam apa ini?

318
00:33:31,134 --> 00:33:32,885
Kenapa pakai baju begitu?

319
00:33:34,303 --> 00:33:37,015
Orang bergaya kuno dilarang komentar.

320
00:33:37,098 --> 00:33:38,266
Gaya kuno?

321
00:33:38,349 --> 00:33:40,476
Hei, ini baju mahal.

322
00:34:00,621 --> 00:34:02,623
Semua orang hidup bergairah.

323
00:34:13,342 --> 00:34:14,510
Dapat dari mana?

324
00:34:15,219 --> 00:34:16,679
Bar itu menjualnya.

325
00:34:16,763 --> 00:34:18,973
Tunjukkan gelang, gratis sampai 5.000 won.

326
00:34:20,641 --> 00:34:23,478
Bukankah harusnya ini pakai uang kantor?

327
00:34:23,561 --> 00:34:25,980
Kita selalu pakai dana pribadi.

328
00:34:26,773 --> 00:34:28,066
Kau jangan minum ini.

329
00:34:28,149 --> 00:34:29,859
Apa yang termahal? Beli itu.

330
00:34:31,402 --> 00:34:32,904
Ada yang 100 juta.

331
00:34:33,905 --> 00:34:37,158
PAKET NARATETAMA 100.000.000

332
00:34:39,160 --> 00:34:40,078
Minum ini saja.

333
00:34:43,039 --> 00:34:44,957
Bagaimana cara mencari Hermes?

334
00:34:47,710 --> 00:34:50,505
PENGACARA MIRAS MENGIRIM FOTO

335
00:34:52,423 --> 00:34:53,925
Katanya, cari tas merah.

336
00:34:54,842 --> 00:34:55,843
Merah?

337
00:35:03,351 --> 00:35:04,435
Merah.

338
00:35:05,019 --> 00:35:07,480
Mohon maaf.

339
00:35:10,900 --> 00:35:11,776
Bentuknya…

340
00:35:16,072 --> 00:35:17,240
Mohon maaf.

341
00:35:19,283 --> 00:35:21,327
Sial. Warna merah.

342
00:35:55,653 --> 00:35:57,029
Bentuknya mirip semua.

343
00:35:57,864 --> 00:35:58,698
Aku bingung.

344
00:36:58,633 --> 00:36:59,634
Itu.

345
00:37:00,885 --> 00:37:02,637
- Benar, 'kan?
- Benar.

346
00:37:02,720 --> 00:37:03,763
Bedebah gila?

347
00:37:03,846 --> 00:37:05,264
- Apa, Bajingan?
- Gila.

348
00:37:05,348 --> 00:37:06,474
Tolong pergi.

349
00:37:07,099 --> 00:37:08,643
Lain kali, kuberi gratis.

350
00:37:10,728 --> 00:37:11,562
Ayo pergi.

351
00:37:28,037 --> 00:37:30,998
Sempurna.
Aku bisa ke pertemuan tepat waktu.

352
00:37:34,001 --> 00:37:36,337
Kau Hermes, 'kan?

353
00:37:37,588 --> 00:37:38,756
Tuan Kang Sang-ung?

354
00:37:40,508 --> 00:37:43,261
Aku ada urusan denganmu.

355
00:37:51,602 --> 00:37:53,354
Kau menemukanku di sini.

356
00:37:53,437 --> 00:37:55,064
Kukira kau tak bisa datang.

357
00:37:55,606 --> 00:37:57,400
Ada urusan apa? Jawablah.

358
00:37:57,900 --> 00:37:59,777
Dia berbicara santai.

359
00:38:00,778 --> 00:38:03,322
Jika salah langkah, aku bisa terlambat.

360
00:38:05,992 --> 00:38:07,493
Rupanya kau seperti kami.

361
00:38:08,703 --> 00:38:11,831
Mau gabung asosiasi?
Minum teh dan mengudap tiap akhir pekan.

362
00:38:12,832 --> 00:38:14,542
Kuberi formulir registrasi.

363
00:38:24,010 --> 00:38:25,386
Kau hanya bawa segini?

364
00:38:26,679 --> 00:38:29,307
Baru-baru ini, gajiku sampai dipotong.

365
00:38:30,474 --> 00:38:31,892
Aku agak kesulitan.

366
00:38:51,579 --> 00:38:52,455
Sial.

367
00:38:55,624 --> 00:38:57,960
Kau takkan bisa bergabung asosiasi.

368
00:39:11,640 --> 00:39:13,017
Tuan Direktur Jo Nathan

369
00:39:14,101 --> 00:39:15,394
ingin aku membawamu.

370
00:39:15,478 --> 00:39:17,021
Sepertinya itu sulit.

371
00:39:17,855 --> 00:39:19,690
Aku ada janji penting nanti.

372
00:39:43,130 --> 00:39:43,964
Hei.

373
00:39:44,548 --> 00:39:45,758
Pukul saja aku!

374
00:40:02,149 --> 00:40:02,983
Lagi pula,

375
00:40:04,068 --> 00:40:05,152
dia tak kelihatan.

376
00:40:42,898 --> 00:40:44,108
Hei, Paman!

377
00:40:44,900 --> 00:40:45,943
- Gila.
- Kenapa?

378
00:40:46,902 --> 00:40:49,238
- Bajumu kenapa?
- Tuan Pengacara.

379
00:40:50,823 --> 00:40:53,159
- Ya.
- Hermes manusia super.

380
00:40:53,242 --> 00:40:56,328
- Aku dapat obatnya. Kami keluar.
- Serius? Manusia super?

381
00:40:56,412 --> 00:40:58,664
Kita harus waspada. Cepat pergi.

382
00:41:05,754 --> 00:41:06,797
Kenapa?

383
00:41:07,506 --> 00:41:08,883
Karena kuminta kau pasrah?

384
00:41:09,467 --> 00:41:11,802
Aku merasa bisa membawanya sendiri.

385
00:41:19,018 --> 00:41:20,269
Itu tak seru.

386
00:41:28,777 --> 00:41:30,446
Astaga, mohon maaf.

387
00:41:35,826 --> 00:41:37,244
Permisi. Mohon maaf.

388
00:41:38,412 --> 00:41:39,538
Kenapa ini?

389
00:41:40,456 --> 00:41:41,790
- Apa?
- Astaga.

390
00:41:45,586 --> 00:41:47,379
Ada apa? Kejutan?

391
00:42:35,094 --> 00:42:40,474
UNTUKMU YANG BERUSAHA
DEMI ORANG LAIN MESKI TAK DIAKUI

392
00:42:53,654 --> 00:42:54,738
Itu Jo Nathan.

393
00:43:11,338 --> 00:43:12,339
Apa ini?

394
00:43:34,445 --> 00:43:37,531
Biasanya kelab tidak begini, 'kan?

395
00:43:39,283 --> 00:43:43,203
Semua orang ingin menjadi istimewa.

396
00:43:49,168 --> 00:43:50,044
Ada apa ini?

397
00:43:52,004 --> 00:43:52,921
KAU PUN BISA…

398
00:44:03,682 --> 00:44:04,558
Ayo.

399
00:44:11,482 --> 00:44:14,735
Namun, sebagai orang berpengalaman,

400
00:44:15,235 --> 00:44:20,115
aku bersumpah,
hidup normal adalah yang terbaik.

401
00:44:24,411 --> 00:44:25,746
GRATIS

402
00:44:28,624 --> 00:44:30,209
- Roti-mi!
- Tangkap! Hei!

403
00:44:30,292 --> 00:44:31,794
Di sana! Minggir!

404
00:44:31,877 --> 00:44:33,337
- Sial.
- Berikan padaku.

405
00:44:35,714 --> 00:44:37,007
Dasar kau! Astaga.

406
00:44:38,300 --> 00:44:39,218
Ya, ampun!

407
00:44:40,052 --> 00:44:41,053
Ambil!

408
00:44:46,934 --> 00:44:48,560
Itu tasku! Astaga.

409
00:44:49,311 --> 00:44:51,188
- Tasku!
- Minggir!

410
00:44:56,860 --> 00:44:58,278
Tidak!

411
00:45:02,574 --> 00:45:03,951
Tidak. Sialan!

412
00:45:18,757 --> 00:45:20,759
Jika obatnya direbut,

413
00:45:21,260 --> 00:45:24,012
semua orang akan mati.

414
00:45:31,311 --> 00:45:32,813
Miskin adalah dosa.

415
00:45:32,896 --> 00:45:33,897
Lihat itu.

416
00:45:34,481 --> 00:45:36,066
Dia bergeming tanpa uang.

417
00:45:45,242 --> 00:45:46,076
Jangan!

418
00:45:54,585 --> 00:45:55,669
Tuan Sang-ung.

419
00:46:00,466 --> 00:46:01,633
Tuan Sang-ung.

420
00:46:07,181 --> 00:46:08,182
Roti-mi!

421
00:46:23,238 --> 00:46:27,242
MIN-SUK

422
00:46:31,038 --> 00:46:33,207
Panggilan tak terhubung. Tinggalkan…

423
00:46:57,564 --> 00:47:00,526
Tampaknya aku salah menentukan…

424
00:47:03,111 --> 00:47:04,905
hari pertemuan keluarga.

425
00:50:05,168 --> 00:50:08,422
Terjemahan subtitle oleh Siti Muthia Hasna
